    <string name="mesh_secure_enrollment_pending">This build previews the Android app and packaging. Password-protected enrollment and payment-backed reauthentication are still being implemented. The old lab enrollment protocol is disabled here; do not use production credentials.</string>
    <string name="mesh_disclosure_title">Use Scout Mesh VPN?</string>
    <string name="mesh_disclosure_message">Scout creates an encrypted split tunnel for its own requests to your selected Scout hub on 10.66.0.0/16. The hub receives your device connection information and the routing, search, and hazard requests you send. Device location is sent only if you enable tracking; destinations and map areas you choose are still sent to provide those features. The tunnel does not route other apps or protect your general internet traffic. The hub operator processes these requests to provide Scout services. You can disconnect at any time from Scout or the VPN notification.</string>
